<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">Because the minimum offering of our common
stock is less than $100,000,000, Pennsylvania investors are cautioned to carefully evaluate our ability to fully accomplish our
