<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">We will provide this information to you via
one or more of the following methods, in our discretion and with your consent, if necessary: posting on our website and on your
personal dashboard on our website at <U>www.RichUncles.com</U>, U.S. mail or other courier; electronic delivery; or in a filing
