<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B><I>When will I get my detailed tax information?</I></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 20.15pt">Your Form 1099-DIV tax information will be mailed
