    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">increase awareness of the &ldquo;Rich Uncles NNN REIT, Inc.&rdquo; name within the investment products market;</FONT></TD></TR>
</TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

