    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">attract, integrate, motivate and retain qualified personnel to manage our day-to-day operations;</FONT></TD></TR>
</TABLE>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.1in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&bull;</FONT></TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">respond to competition for our targeted real estate properties and other investments as well as for potential investors; and</FONT></TD></TR>
