<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD ROWSPAN="2" STYLE="padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-right: 3pt; padding-bottom: 0.75pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Acquisition Fee (2)</FONT></TD>
    <TD ROWSPAN="2" STYLE="padding: 0.75pt 3pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">For each acquisition, we will pay our advisor 3.0% of the cost of the investment. The total of all acquisition fees and acquisition expenses shall be reasonable, and shall not exceed 6.0% of the contract price of the property. However, a majority of the directors (including a majority of our conflicts committee) not otherwise interested in the transaction may approve fees in excess of these limits if they determine the transaction to be commercially competitive, fair and reasonable to us.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-bottom: 0.75pt; padding-left: 3pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">$58,200,000, assuming use of our target leverage of 50%</FONT></TD></TR>
