    <TD STYLE="padding: 0.75pt 3pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Other than with respect to any mortgage or other financing related to a Property concurrent with its acquisition, if our advisor provides services in connection with the post-acquisition financing or refinancing of any debt that we obtain relative to Properties or the REIT, we will pay the advisor or its assignees a financing coordination fee equal to 1.0% of the amount of such financing.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 0.75pt; padding-bottom: 0.75pt; padding-left: 3pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Not determinable at this time.</FONT></TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
