disclosure of all material terms, factors and circumstances surrounding any and all transactions involving us and our advisor,
a director or any affiliate thereof during the year, which disclosure has been examined and commented upon in the report by our
conflicts committee with regard to the fairness of such transactions.</FONT></TD>
