<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Our advisory agreement with our advisor requires that our advisor
inform our conflicts committee each quarter of the investments that have been purchased by other Rich Uncles-sponsored programs
and Rich Uncles-advised investors for whom our advisor or one of its affiliates serves as an investment advisor so that our conflicts
committee can evaluate whether we are receiving our fair share of opportunities. Our advisor&rsquo;s success in generating investment
