<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">Tenants will be required to provide proof
of insurance by furnishing a certificate of insurance to our advisor on an annual basis. The insurance certificates will be tracked
