<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">The shopping center purchased by Firewheel
comprises 24% of the purchase price of all properties purchased by both programs, and the commercial properties purchased by Rich
Uncles I comprise 76% of the purchase price of all properties purchased by both programs.</P>

