<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.1in">&bull;</TD><TD>each distribution reinvested for your account during the period;</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.1in; text-indent: -0.1in">&nbsp;</P>


