<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">Any agreements between the Operating Partnership
and our affiliates would require the approval of our conflicts committee.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">Under an amended and restated partnership
agreement, we expect that the Operating Partnership would continue to pay all of the administrative and operating costs and expenses
it incurs in acquiring or originating and operating and managing our investments. The Operating Partnership would also pay all
of our administrative costs and expenses and such expenses would be treated as expenses of the Operating Partnership. Such expenses
would include:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">&nbsp;</P>

